{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297919","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297919","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029791901:1":{"text":"오늘도 새로운 일이 잔뜩이군.","source_cn":"今天又来了一堆新工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13E93934174BA164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791902:1":{"text":"하루 종일 일을 처리하고 겨우 끝났나 싶으면, 다음 날에 또 일거리가 몰려오는군.","source_cn":"每天的事务都堆积如山，好不容易处理完，第二天又来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DD23FFB7BEC56E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791903:1":{"text":"루카, 그쪽은 어떤가?","source_cn":"卢卡，你那边怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD003F942B2C729AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791904:1":{"text":"어려운 일이 있다면 언제든 말하도록. 인원을 조정해 주지.","source_cn":"如果有困难，随时和我说，我好调配人员。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4202F0BBB66FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791905:1":{"text":"전체적으로 괜찮습니다. 그 말썽쟁이들도 적당히 협조하고 있고요.","source_cn":"整体还好，那些臭小子们还算配合。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF0CC3D501A6F44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791906:1":{"text":"수고했어. 네가 복잡한 일을 싫어하는 건 잘 알고 있어.","source_cn":"你辛苦了。我知道，你不喜欢繁琐具体的事务。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F13E08F801B32B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791907:1":{"text":"괜찮습니다. 처음부터 잘 하는 사람도 없고요. 잘 알고 계시지 않습니까?","source_cn":"没什么事是一开始就擅长的，索尼娅，你不也是一样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92BD4FEF7958A476","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791908:1":{"text":"인원 조정이 주먹 쓰는 것보다 머리 아프긴 하지만, 못 할 건 아닙니다.","source_cn":"虽说调拨人手确实比打拳要费脑子得多，但也没有多难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8625E5F44636F829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029791909:1":{"text":"여전히 승부욕이 넘치는군.","source_cn":"你还是这么不服输。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD69053F651EA3373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029791910:1":{"text":"자, 그러면 계속 힘내자고. 아직 할 일이 많아.","source_cn":"那，接下来就接着一起加油吧，活儿还有不少呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EFA75EE0118081C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}